            "title": "Self-Driving Technology Maker Luminar Files Bankruptcy",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "The technology company said it has entered chapter 11 with the support of 91% of its first lien noteholders and 86% of its second lien noteholders to sell its LiDAR business, making scanners that use pulsed lasers to sense distances to nearby targets.  Quantum Computing  has separately agreed to acquire another subsidiary, Luminar Semiconductor, in an all-cash transaction valued at $110 million, Quantum said Monday.  To facilitate these transactions, fund the chapter 11 cases and support operations throughout the marketing and sale process, creditors have consented to Luminar\u2019s use of $25 million of cash previously pledged as collateral, the company said.",
